# HAFSA SHASTHO — Cursor Rules (Auto-loaded by Claude Code)

## READ FIRST
Before any work, read CLAUDE_CONTEXT.md in the project root for full architecture.

## ABSOLUTE RULES (violations = reject the code)

1. NO medical logic in UI components (screens/). Medical assessments ONLY in services/rules/*.js
2. NO LLM/Claude imports outside services/claudeAPI.js. This app is LLM-agnostic.
3. NO Supabase calls outside services/supabaseService.js. Screens never talk to Supabase directly.
4. EVERY AsyncStorage write MUST also update AppContext (context/AppContext.js) so other screens see changes immediately.
5. EVERY new Supabase table row MUST have user_id with RLS policy.
6. NEVER use fetch() for Claude API streaming. Use XMLHttpRequest (React Native fetch doesn't support streaming).
7. NEVER put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY or any secret in client code. Keys come from .env via @env.

## PATTERNS TO FOLLOW

- Date operations: use dayjs (imported from services/rules/dateUtils.js). Never use raw new Date() for calculations.
- Bengali numbers: use toBengaliNumber() from utils/helpers.js for all user-facing numbers.
- Baby ID for Supabase: use getSupabaseBabyId() from supabaseService.js (local IDs like baby-xxx differ from Supabase UUIDs).
- Background sync: after every local save, call the corresponding sync function from supabaseService.js with .catch() — never await it in the UI thread.
- Error handling: wrap all async operations in try/catch with Bengali error messages.

## ARCHITECTURE

- Intelligence Service (services/intelligenceService.js) is the brain. Screens call it for insights/alerts/assessments.
- Rules Engine (services/rules/*.js) returns STRUCTURED DATA, never Bengali text.
- Claude (via hafsaPrompt.js → claudeAPI.js) receives pre-computed assessments and wraps them in empathetic Bengali.
- Offline-first: AsyncStorage is primary, Supabase syncs in background. App works without internet.

## AFTER EVERY CHANGE

Self-review checklist:
- [ ] No medical logic in UI?
- [ ] No direct Supabase calls from screens?
- [ ] No LLM imports outside claudeAPI.js?
- [ ] AsyncStorage writes also update AppContext?
- [ ] Background Supabase sync added with .catch()?
- [ ] Bengali numbers use toBengaliNumber()?
- [ ] Date operations use dayjs?
- [ ] Error handling with try/catch?
- [ ] Test plan included in response?
